{% comment %}
  ZAVELYN HAIR CARE — Botanical Harvest & Extraction Heritage (Bespoke for P01 Pure Batana Oil)
{% endcomment %}
<section class="zvhc-harvest-section zvhc-harvest-origin-section" style="padding: 72px 0; background: #FAF7F2; border-top: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD);">
  <div class="zvhc-container">
    <div style="text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 48px;">
      <div style="font-size: 0.78rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--zvhc-t01-accent-rose, #B0476E); letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 8px;">BOTANICAL SOURCING HERITAGE</div>
      <h2 class="zvhc-h2">Wild-Harvested Honduran Batana</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.6;">
        Sourced directly from native <em>Elaeis oleifera</em> palms in the tropical rainforest canopy of La Mosquitia, Honduras. Produced using centuries-old artisanal roasting that preserves delicate phytosterols and restorative bio-lipids.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 24px;">
      <!-- Pillar 1 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; background: #FDF2F6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          🌴
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); margin-bottom: 8px;">Wild Rainforest Canopy</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
          Gathered by local indigenous communities from wild-growing palm nuts. Never cultivated on monoculture industrial plantations; zero chemical pesticides or artificial fertilizers.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 2 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; background: #FDF2F6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          🔥
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); margin-bottom: 8px;">Artisanal Wood-Fire Roasting</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
          Traditional wood-fire roasting releases active phytosterols and gives authentic Batana its dark golden hue and natural roasted aroma. Pure cold expeller-pressed with zero chemical solvents.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Pillar 3 -->
      <div style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--zvhc-t01-border, #EAD7DD); border-radius: 14px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">
        <div style="width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 10px; background: #FDF2F6; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; font-size: 1.4rem; margin-bottom: 16px;">
          🔬
        </div>
        <h3 style="font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-main, #2B1B24); margin-bottom: 8px;">Lipid Barrier Affinity</h3>
        <p style="font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--zvhc-t01-text-muted, #5A4651); line-height: 1.6; margin: 0;">
          With over 50% oleic acid (Omega-9), Batana oil mimics the scalp's natural cutaneous sebum, allowing deep penetration into hair cuticles rather than sitting heavy on the surface.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "ZVHC Harvest Origin",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
